  "plan": "Write a comprehensive C test that: (1) prints full wte/wpe stats in the name-sorted layout, (2) tests all combinations of gamma+1 and transposed weights with both "The" (464) and "The quick brown" (464, 2361, 6381) prompts, printing top-5 predictions for each. This will identify the correct configuration.",
